      "id": "fastdata.arc::サウンドモード_off.rct::decorative-quote",
      "source": "And death and the grave were thrown into the lake of fire.\nThis is the second death—the lake of fire.\nAnd anyone whose name was not found recorded\nin the Book of Life was thrown into the lake of fire.",
